# STIG RHEL-09-211010: Vendor-supported release
# STIG ID: V-257777 (HIGH)

META
    esp_id `r9-rhel-09-211010-os-release-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `rocky9`
    criticality `critical`

    title `STIG RHEL-09-211010: RHEL 9 must be a vendor-supported release.`
    description `RHEL 9 must be a vendor-supported release.`
    author `example-security`
    tags `rhel9,stig,disa-stig,os-release`

    control_mapping `DISA-STIG:RHEL-09-211010,NIST-800-53:CM-6`
    control_objective `CM-6`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `Rocky9:localhost:os-hardening`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `1`
    recommendation `Review and remediate per DISA STIG guidance for RHEL-09-211010.`

    component_id `comp-r9-os`

    impl_CM_6 `This control is validated by checking the required system configuration against the DISA STIG baseline for RHEL 9.`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT os_info
        release_file `/etc/os-release`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE supported_release
        supported boolean = true
        version_id string starts `9.`
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN os_release
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF supported_release
            OBJECT_REF os_info
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
